eeper after the  war in europe but it was also before the  war uh in europe so we're very happy  that you know we're very proud that we  could also contribute on the stability  of the energy market  so ali  between germany and qatar are very good  the relations are developing and we have  a lot of domains to work and to support  and to increase  we  spoke about the  cooperation in order to overcome the  problems in the region the afghani  matter  we have talked about it and it's quite  important to work together  very closely in order to achieve and the  future will prove this we are quite  connected when it comes to  economy  it's not because of the current  situation and because of the  gaza impulse also the  inputs and exports from both countries  are increasing and this is an expression  about the good relations between our  countries we need to  continue this and we need to improve  this when it comes to the energy it's an  important matter for us  germany wants to  improve its infrastructure in order to  have  gas  pipes and  to  import gas  through ships and qatar is playing this  big role in our strategy also we  understood that this matter is not  related to germany  there are so many countries that are not  on the coastal road  and  on  the northern sea sports and they need to  be supported and qatar can't play a role  in this regard this is quite important  we talk about uh  contract  with iran  we hope that we  can have an agreement to be put on the  table of negotiations and to be accepted  by all the parties uh concerned  in order to  is there a certain quantity to  export energy when it comes to the world  cup you say that you want to welcome the  german fans in qatar what about  the german  gays  do you think they must stay in  germany german guests or do they have to  stay home  and understand  afghanistan  your technical question about the  quantities of energy we  have said that the quantities will be  doubled between 2023 to 2027 the  quantities 